   "q": "How do I tell the NRC when I can referee?",
   "a": "<p>On your home, under <b>When I can referee</b>, tap a weekend to cycle it: available, tentative, unavailable. Each tap saves. A weekend covers Friday to Sunday. For any other period, weekdays included, use <b>Other dates</b>, then <b>Save these dates</b>.</p>",
